{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018G8UtPPAZRVXZuUveq5hXX","type":"tool_result","content":"/-- If every bag has at most `k + 1` vertices, the width is at most `k`. -/\ntheorem width_le_of_forall_card_le {G : SimpleGraph V} (P : PathDecomposition G) {k : ℕ}\n    (h : ∀ i, (P.bag i).card ≤ k + 1) : P.width ≤ k := by\n  unfold width\n  have : Finset.sup' (Finset.univ (α := Fin (P.length + 1)))\n      (Finset.univ_nonempty_iff.mpr ⟨⟨0, Nat.zero_lt_succ _⟩⟩)\n      (fun i => (P.bag i).card) ≤ k + 1 := Finset.sup'_le _ _ (fun i _ => h i)\n  omega\n\nend PathDecomposition\n\n/-- To compare pathwidths it suffices to turn each decomposition of `G` into one\n----INDUCE_DEC\n.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Combinatorics/SimpleGraph/Maps.lean:143:    DecidableRel (G.comap f).Adj := fun _ _ ↦ ‹DecidableRel G.Adj› _ _\n----CARD\nMOSPFormalization/TreeBound.lean:1789:      simp only [Finset.coe_sort_coe, Fintype.card_coe]\n----MAXIMAL\n----ULIFT\n.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Data/Fintype/Card.lean:186:theorem Fintype.card_ulift (α : Type*) [Fintype α] : Fintype.card (ULift α) = Fintype.card α :=\n.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Data/Fintype/Option.lean:73:      simp only [card_fin, card_pempty, card_ulift]\n.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Data/Fintype/Option.lean:80:      simp only [card_fin, card_option, card_ulift]\n----PRECONN\n.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Combinatorics/SimpleGraph/Connectivity/Connected.lean:123:protected theorem Reachable.map {u v : V} {G : SimpleGraph V} {G' : SimpleGraph V'} (f : G →g G')\n.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Combinatorics/SimpleGraph/Finite.lean:265:theorem degree_pos_iff_exists_adj : 0 < G.degree v ↔ ∃ w, G.Adj v w := by\n.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Combinatorics/SimpleGraph/Finite.lean:270:  G.degree_pos_iff_exists_adj v\n.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Combinatorics/SimpleGraph/Finite.lean:281:  rw [G.degree_pos_iff_exists_adj v, mem_support]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id